title: T-004 VideoProject scaffold shipped + codebase audit pass
summary: 'Landed T-004 — the VideoProject folder convention (source.<ext>/project.atelier/transcript.json/cuts.json/export/) — as the foundational scaffolding for the UGC workflow. New pure-interface types in @a-company/atelier-types (CutEntry, VideoCutList, TranscriptWord, TranscriptSegment, VideoTranscript, VideoProjectManifest) and Node.js filesystem utilities in the CLI package (createVideoProject, loadVideoProject, readCutList/writeCutList, readTranscript/writeTranscript, readComposition/writeComposition). createVideoProject is idempotent — safe to re-run on an existing folder without overwriting. Draft composition scaffolds a single VideoVisual clip; atelier edit (T-005) will fill in videoMeta and real canvas dimensions after ffprobe. Followed up with a workspace-wide audit and fix pass: restored strict typecheck on packages/canvas (3× TS6133 unused-var errors), added 8 smoke tests to packages/video so vitest no longer exits 1 on the package, dogfooded atelier lint against valid and invalid fixtures (correct exit 0/1 behavior), and confirmed no production TODO/FIXME drift. Versions bumped — types 0.26.0→0.27.0, CLI 0.29.0→0.30.0.'
symbols_touched:
